# Force LF in the working tree for all text files — claudart's parsers and
# tests are line-ending sensitive (regexes and literal comparisons match \n).
# Without this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true get CRLF files and
# 40+ tests fail. Normalize in the repo, keep LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.dart text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
